<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Deelkraal Q2 pre-capex net loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Deelkraal Q2 pre-capex net loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss before capital spending    2.36 vs 0.23 loss</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 14.44 vs 13.63</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		     2,089.2 vs 1,930.4</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		319,000 vs 325,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     6.5 vs 5.9</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  51,033 vs 51,347</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     49,424 vs 51,941</p>
<p>Full name: Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said tonnage milled is expected to increase at a slightly reduced yield.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
